Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Police say he pointed a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.60,0:00:02.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,gun at a gas station
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.95,0:00:04.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,— then ran from deputies
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.64,0:00:06.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,for eighteen miles in a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.24,0:00:07.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,stolen Kia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:08.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sunday night, about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.29,0:00:10.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,nine-forty, White Bear Lake,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.14,0:00:10.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,Minnesota.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.87,0:00:12.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,An officer tried to stop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.47,0:00:13.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,a driver who had just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.84,0:00:15.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,left that gas station.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.29,0:00:16.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,He kept going.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.18,0:00:17.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,A Ramsey County deputy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.71,0:00:19.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,took the lead on Interstate
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:20.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,six-ninety-four.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.77,0:00:22.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,In Anoka, a deputy laid
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.21,0:00:23.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,down stop sticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.34,0:00:24.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,He drove right over them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.95,0:00:26.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,— and kept going.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:27.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,Eleven minutes in, the deputy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.93,0:00:29.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,ended it with a PIT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.14,0:00:29.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,maneuver.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.78,0:00:31.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,Deputies say the Kia was
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.39,0:00:31.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.88,0:00:33.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thirty-year-old Jaime Alexis
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.97,0:00:36.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,Escoto Rodriguez of Richfield
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.06,0:00:37.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,was arrested and is awaiting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.99,0:00:38.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,charges.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:38.56,Headline,,0,0,0,,GUN. STOLEN KIA.\N18 MILES. ONE MOVE.
